<section class="hero" id="hero">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-text">
      <h1 class="hero-name">Ricardo Zavala</h1>
      <p class="hero-title">Senior Full Stack Engineer</p>
      <p class="hero-location">Henderson, NV</p>
      <p class="hero-bio">
        I once mass-deployed a "fix" that turned every button on the page into a llama emoji.
        Survived. Still employed. Probably the world's foremost expert on accidentally nuking
        staging databases at 2 AM and then quietly fixing it before standup. My code has been
        described as "surprisingly functional" by at least one tech lead. Outside of tech, I hold
        the unofficial neighborhood record for most consecutive days forgetting to water a cactus.
        It died. I'm not proud of it.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-links">
        <a class="hero-link" href="https://github.com/rzavala1989" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
